{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OpsCam is a team-based multiplayer game. Players engage in fast-paced combat in close-range environments. Join other players in thrilling PvP battles and coordinate with your team to defeat the opposing team.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/extras/primeira.gif?t=1745944004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The customization system allows you to tailor your weapon to suit your needs. Modify sights, grips, barrels, and accessories to achieve optimal performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try it out and have fun!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3088080?t=1745944004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/edcec041fea3491faef20a738c6dd6b63b41b748/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745944004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/62fcc3d0908c193dea1d2ab70fbbf0466d3755d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745944004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/62fcc3d0908c193dea1d2ab70fbbf0466d3755d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745944004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"O jogo cont\u00e9m representa\u00e7\u00f5es de viol\u00eancia moderada/intensa, incluindo combates armados, gritos agonizantes de dor. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 representa\u00e7\u00f5es de atos sexuais, agress\u00e3o sexual ou sexo n\u00e3o consensual. O jogo tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o aborda temas como abuso de drogas, \u00e1lcool ou autoflagela\u00e7\u00e3o. Recomendado para jogadores maiores de de 17, devido \u00e0 natureza do conte\u00fado.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OpsCam is a team-based multiplayer game. Players engage in fast-paced combat in close-range environments. Join other players in thrilling PvP battles and coordinate with your team to defeat the opposing team.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/extras/primeira.gif?t=1745944004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The customization system allows you to tailor your weapon to suit your needs. Modify sights, grips, barrels, and accessories to achieve optimal performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try it out and have fun!</p>","developers":["LAC Games BR"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/6ea993e85a9d8a0a23f90d421d037bd8ba27caad/header.jpg?t=1745944004","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132855,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132855/movie480.mp4?t=1745944002","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132855/movie_max.mp4?t=1745944002"},"name":"OpsCam Trailler","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132855/e3f3fd2aa8d7bfd1afb00623e12cf82eefcd73ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745944002","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132855/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745944002","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132855/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745944002"}}],"name":"OpsCam","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10<br></